      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Urbancrest%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village was incorporated in 1948, becoming an official municipality after nearly 60 years of growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Urbancrest%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Urbancrest borders the city of Columbus to the south and the village of Grove City to the west.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Urbancrest%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Village of Urbancrest proudly calls itself the “Historical Village of Urbancrest,” a title that reflects its long‑standing community roots.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
