        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.villageofurbancrestoh.us/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Urbancrest’s location makes it an attractive spot for commercial and industrial development with tax abatement incentives.",
